  "description": "Part redevelopment, part alterations to accommodate uses falling within use class D1, including a place of worship, non-residential teaching and training, with ancillary uses including offices, charity distribution and residential flat, associated access, parking and landscape improvements",
  "site_name": "Riverside Vineyard Church",
